# TV: no sliders

- **Never** use `Slider`, seek bars, or continuous drag controls on TV UI (D-pad / remote).
- Prefer discrete steps: buttons, focusable chips, +/- steppers, list items, or system controls.
- Phone-only screens may use sliders; shared UI that can run on TV must not.
